et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3mQ9i5waHSIQ7kNvwE4ketE&_nc_oc=AdmFu48_Ms1ScIBugCo1qv9_mK63IDVQ5IrQovfPv_XE-EIP2cR7zYlgY4VnMZHOJ7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsnY9Urh3UU-ORXcAa_wVCECOTVqBEKf6ZEzpBRTxI6QQ&oe=6999B59F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l5Oa0FGSmeUQ7kNvwFcNEun&_nc_oc=Adkd1c7SGf2_yU7P6WaoOT702vmey_JJrzLf63-BGchaVp0EdvoLVUwzKZ7pNHBt_EM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftjkpKX3tmLqn4WaFnXK1qgiTeJMozKPwc0PM2Zt5-DFA&oe=6999B187"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FR5BcjD6QsYQ7kNvwE2sjDW&_nc_oc=AdmGanbbGLVpcYBS1YYKNT6NGPi1fjHRTCSEao62-9Ae06XDFnyrRhnSr4fGhrfCtQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuR8d7t4vlgig2b7qOz_WWciEQjVNfsoi4ikWFOBkMuMg&oe=6999B5D7"}, {"file_name": "